{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "68eaad2a80a6c279b64dcab3b24be8fbcfc028890cf2b3e13bdac2292cb2bafd", "ja": "あなたの中で永遠に生き続けるよ", "zh": "我会永远活在你的心中哦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d20a7753ed7efc2ac069ae3344db914436b3d6c663343197b595ee59b426b2ca", "ja": "再びイベント出演のため、西エリアに\nやってきた4人。以前とは違い\n『D.O.S.S.』の圧にも負けず、本番前の\n顔見せを乗り切る。そしてステージでも、\nペースを崩すことはなかった。", "zh": "为了再次参加活动演出，4人来到了西区。与之前不同，这次他们没有被『D.O.S.S.』的压迫感击垮，顺利完成了正式演出前的亮相。即使在舞台上，也没有打乱节奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d5b54d71fba35886997f43dd321c00f31330317f62bff2a28d32c4fd49943a50", "ja": "（イベント出演のため、再び西エリアにやってきた。\nこの間の雪辱、なんとか晴らさないとな……！）", "zh": "（为了参加活动，又一次来到了西区。这次一定要设法雪耻……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "60f5db0b6bf7056637b31be075379daaae2fc0eec779ca59dd70442844585a1e", "ja": "あの、仕掛け人さま。本番が始まるまで、\n隣でお話していてもよろしいですか？", "zh": "那个，制作人。在正式演出开始之前，可以陪我在旁边聊聊天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "8ffc9494a9a813b36e6ad171f38b68851ef4b8280748fe9823c0f9efef145bf7", "ja": "こうして仕掛け人さまとお話していれば、\n不安を感じる暇もないと思うので……。", "zh": "只要像这样和制作人先生聊聊天，就没时间感到不安了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "560a62760a16e1d655490f1bf699e0d3025109b4294743ef7124274a82c5974a", "ja": "もちろん、どうぞ！\nあれ、志保もか？", "zh": "当然可以，请吧！\n咦，志保你也来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "96813f834ad322f03205a5d50bc9db82f2e6f257707f855f4b742967194e5e56", "ja": "はい。それに、人数がいたほうが、\n相手の入るスキもなくなると思いますし……。", "zh": "是的。而且人多一点的话，我觉得也不会给对方留下可乘之机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "1a1a5756b2db190fabbe2b25ca01a3b89bd360b063befb4bc30ea7c0f95b2506", "ja": "！　噂をすれば……来たみたいですね。", "zh": "！说曹操曹操到……好像来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1006_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "ba38ef13456c9e661bc41429eec194c36cc8bb40a1ee9e1057f456ff7d84daef", "ja": "ようおこしやす、プロデューサーはん！\n相変わらず素敵やねぇ♪", "zh": "欢迎光临，制作人先生！\n你还是一样那么有魅力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1007_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "33e05957fa639843c4ceaa3590a3feccabdde3284a546b5a5dd1a65630aa122f", "ja": "会いたかったわぁ♪　またうちらと\nおしゃべり、付き合ってくれます？", "zh": "我一直想见你呀♪　还愿意再陪我们聊聊天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "eec6bb6a486b31639e896795c4b2eb18b7827fbf67449cef90bd7da87f90d28e", "ja": "本日もよろしくお願いします。その前に……\nこの前は、時間が押して紹介できなかったので。", "zh": "今天也请多多关照。在那之前……\n上次时间来不及，没能介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "482b90f43ab22e7139023fe36577dc32a923bed1a825fd60f0cf3f414438ea92", "ja": "765プロ自慢のアイドル達です。\n昴、エミリー、志保で……あれ、亜美は？", "zh": "她们是765艺能引以为傲的偶像们。\n这是昴、艾米莉、志保……咦，亚美呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "7bff31fb1b3c3dd948c8b372ec854761bebb5ff4d764bc3ff453ad349b03812e", "ja": "亜美なら、さっきスマホを\n片手に外に出ていきましたけど……。", "zh": "如果是亚美的话，她刚才单手拿着手机出去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ea8a0086f1d5c1a0d385c1d2d11caf32ca3fccee262509d9998f9f1ba7844c75", "ja": "仕方ないな……。スマホを持って行ったなら、\n連絡は取れるか……ええと。", "zh": "没办法了……既然她带着手机出去的，应该还能联系上吧……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1012_se", "source_sha256": "a79b3297cc1b41f0236340b283cce9e82f1156cb89b8c94f0bf4975f5d867bbf", "ja": "バチバチッ！！！", "zh": "噼里啪啦！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "67d81f65ae933b669286457af533af377b9109368fdeb86b425603c92989c7cd", "ja": "ぐわあああああああっ！？　な、なんだ……？\nスマホを触ったら電気ショックみたいなのが……。", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！？ 这、这是怎么回事……？\n碰了一下手机，居然像触电一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "b9879cb3e38131d08bfc5a08891757e0a3007c7264f7eb1cc16ba0fb7b81a9e5", "ja": "んっふっふ～、大成功！　それは\nスマホじゃなくて、スマホ型のオモチャだよ～だ！", "zh": "嘻嘻嘻～大成功！那不是手机，\n而是手机形状的玩具啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "6edf1260622d3e1edaf111a2e339653b6a828a41d90eae916df65e7bc26182a3", "ja": "あ、兄ちゃんの本物のスマホはちゃんと\n隠してあるから、安心していーよ！", "zh": "啊，哥哥的真手机我已经好好藏起来了，放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8b410c6286a36b870a37976259f548ab0cca22b9a8a68d4833ed29d1814e3a77", "ja": "な、なにが安心なんだ……。\nというか、結構痛いぞ、この電気ショック……。", "zh": "到底有什么好放心的……话说回来，这电击还真疼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1017_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "7693f26c4b59a9a73068503c17840616229c1c0c1fec6d5b653afa55cbe1282e", "ja": "仲良さそうでなによりやわぁ。\n……思ってたより、おもろい女の子やったんね。", "zh": "看起来关系很好，真是太好了。  \n……没想到是个比我想的还要有意思的女孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1018_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "982494af10c0aeba3a7e50c6651925079b65800fdd79e152bf8664ee8ef66445", "ja": "もう少しおしゃべりしたいんやけど……\nうちらもミーティングがあるから、この辺で……。", "zh": "虽然还想再聊一会儿……\n但我们也有会议，就先到这里吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1019_se", "source_sha256": "632766b1963bbd5d65cd118f29217ec32140023fcf0802dafb4fd7ef14cacead", "ja": "パタパタパタ……", "zh": "啪哒啪哒啪哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "a29ad00ba63cc68a9f4f617a439508f12120ff146a7c647d4bd2d526b3c7f770", "ja": "ふう……。なんとか、おふたりの圧に\n押されずにすみましたね！", "zh": "呼……总算没被两位的气势压倒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "1e3c90edfe9687a7a08962729b17c423ab66459b7373d5adc6ca4a6c9fc059ea", "ja": "うむ、危ないところだった……！\nあとしほりん、ナイスアシスト！", "zh": "嗯，好险好险……！\n还有志保凛，配合得太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "dff7cc8035d189ed0ebfe99ea75a4f05fdb3a62ff889b0a00d2a03cff324e479", "ja": "どういたしまして。……これくらいのことで、\n会場の空気がこっちのものにできるとは思わないけど。", "zh": "不客气。……不过我可不认为，光凭这点小事就能把现场的气氛掌控在我们手中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "97fa46b45e7cba761a7448b1a992319e91261e4ed8c7b318ebd208773d2d5121", "ja": "そうだな。謎の圧だけじゃない、実力もある相手だ。\nそして会場は相手のホーム……。", "zh": "没错。对方不只是有神秘的压迫感，也拥有真正的实力。\n而且会场还是对方的主场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "f71ef00e2517baf282eb5f3166d8a193f501ec8bcae8e31e999dc78929b4b103", "ja": "だからこそ、思いっきり見せつけてやろう！\nみんな、準備はいいか？", "zh": "正因为如此，才更要尽情展现给他们看！\n大家，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "b7035657b3f938f3035db88f34d56e2a043c85c7c55361151a2b761d5b55f3e5", "ja": "当然！\n{$P$}、よーく見とけよ！", "zh": "当然！\n{$P$}，你可要好好看着啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "f6d59d03ca4da0fb8ebf0671ba22a5b46c92425d5d60e1e8e7790384473e6e69", "ja": "今度こそ、亜美たちが目にもの見せてくれるぜ！\n皆の者、覚悟するのだ～！", "zh": "这次一定要让你们见识一下，亚美她们的厉害！\n各位，做好觉悟吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1027_null", "source_sha256": "491d2a366db640fe4887819ac180b36dce35df6482ac51bd3a36d9e6b9bd35a3", "ja": "イベント本番……", "zh": "活动正式开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1028_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "69ba8f5a38d6b89ef517ca7345bc83844c185d4fbf19cd0be5f31d3986f55b70", "ja": "みんなー！　盛り上がってるー？\n次は、765プロのアイドルはんの曲やね。", "zh": "大家——！气氛热烈吗——？\n接下来是765事务所偶像的歌曲呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "3b7f502927863f406169fce72cd26f8052ce32ce7a1cca31c2068dd83207520c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　京都の大和撫子の\nみなさんと再び共演できて、とても嬉しいです！", "zh": "谢谢大家！能再次和京都的大和抚子们同台演出，我真的非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1030_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "ff63d0e710657e581755745093ee8869892017d023ab792f9944b84b21b09fe2", "ja": "今日は、新曲を披露しはるんやろ？\nどんな曲なん？", "zh": "今天要演唱新歌，对吧？\n是什么样的歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "abdf7d0aa7e858f51d1eb60a57bca6fb6411cc01ba8da763b6ca6c938b13e1b3", "ja": "私たち4人がお届けするのは、\nSHADE OF SPADEのラブソングです。", "zh": "由我们4人为大家带来的，\n是SHADE OF SPADE的情歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "7f1b630cd4d9f115215db6fad7f7f51aca7ec900c76f313406dda06a543f01ea", "ja": "私たちは、京都のこの舞台と、\n大和撫子のみなさんから、多くを学びました。", "zh": "我们从京都这个舞台，\n以及大和撫子的各位身上，学到了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "6f23fe52181753893eb944fdc6e4cbafe9f35892326e0180c99ca66ad4b718ec", "ja": "その成果を、本日は披露してみせます！", "zh": "今天就让大家见识一下我们的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1034_011ami", "source_sha256": "ef6ba77a13ed2b39fb13112654c926e0390431848e4207256e6dc31963696c0b", "ja": "なでしこの言うとおり！　亜美たちをバッチリ\n成長させたこと、悔しがってもアゴの祭りだかんね！", "zh": "正如抚子所说！就算后悔把亚美她们培养得这么出色，也已经是“下巴祭典”啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1035_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "ed61bc444d7f1caf7c72456003b82aea720eb96c8827c8433adb7255496719c6", "ja": "それを言うなら後の祭りや！\nはっ、ツッコんでもうた……。", "zh": "要说这个，那可就太晚啦！\n哈，一不小心就吐槽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1036_audience", "source_sha256": "9fd03b8fe7a0d9682f99135e8ec2d9b9499f57b71e5c353ed5d8b23a04955127", "ja": "アハハッ！！", "zh": "啊哈哈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "4560ffce2598eb4c81d737a345fad64ddddad0593e19f43c1ffb93f2adad1923", "ja": "『後の祭り』……この言葉の由来は、\n京都の祇園祭が発祥とも言われていますね。", "zh": "“马后炮”……据说也有人认为，这个说法源自京都的祇园祭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "3780b4698fb2b01c5f6ac60731ef83be76530080e5d99def6439731063cb0ee3", "ja": "ごヒイキ様方は、そのようなことにならないよう、\n私たちの舞台をしっかりと見ていってくださいね♪", "zh": "各位贵宾，为了不让事情变成那样，请一定要好好欣赏我们的舞台哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1039_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "ea8f8679d61e2a6f0ac70bad8d228a73ed67d891361a9ead1c705f7aadacfe6c", "ja": "そ、それは知らんかったわ……\nよう調べとるようやね……。", "zh": "这、这个我还真不知道……  \n看来你调查得很仔细啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1040_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "a67e58a04e9c9139ac8bf9cf90c42779964fc968ddceab186f7f47f61f11d88e", "ja": "そんなに京都に興味持ってもらえて嬉しいわぁ。\nほんなら行きたい場所とかあった？", "zh": "你对京都这么感兴趣，我很开心呀。\n那么，有没有想去的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1041_033sih", "source_sha256": "40b3e6756cb7658fe5e7eb8446dab203a9d726baa1a6844eb8c9deb7bae1496c", "ja": "はい。清水寺とか、金閣寺とか……。", "zh": "是的。清水寺、金阁寺之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1042_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "bc27662194b2d754b41f11fa0d7a41afb6466f7c0cd97178754b472e62e19c27", "ja": "えー、そこは掘り下げてくれんと！\nトークで盛り上げたほうがええんやないの？", "zh": "哎呀，那里不深入挖掘一下可不行！  \n不是应该通过聊天把气氛炒热吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "a867687e0a2ec776aca620c19452724462149b95f25d521eca028c2f355f8d7f", "ja": "いえ、特には。私たちはパフォーマンスで、\nみなさんを満足させてみせます。", "zh": "不，没什么特别的。我们会用表演让大家满意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1044_audience", "source_sha256": "292f96f358600c8453166860ba9483ad9c4c3c20fb581718a34f418e7d015ac9", "ja": "おお……！", "zh": "喔喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "9686a7127384110370f292e81f9d6491f125deedbe142e96ae30c56a234dc97c", "ja": "いいじゃんか志保！\n予告ホームランみたいで、超かっこいいぜ！", "zh": "挺不错的嘛志保！\n像预告本垒打一样，超级帅气啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1046_nishiidola", "source_sha256": "b4554dc07cd9f213de3716ddeb29a096daf97663d3bba1a231ac706a513538c0", "ja": "そ、そんならステージの準備も\n整ったみたいやし……歌ってもらおか！", "zh": "那、那样看来舞台也准备好了……请你唱首歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1047_nishiidolb", "source_sha256": "2f02a2318e96ad93ccad89c49ea7213634ae485a930dc745ecd95e5c824305a8", "ja": "せ、せやね……。\n765プロのみなさん、曲ふりを。", "zh": "是、是啊……  \n765制作人们，请进行歌曲介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_06_1048_047sub", "source_sha256": "9cc3ab83df1af04df6618ef3c10a91b1f7dda2872556152a044221c5a658c55e", "ja": "はーい！　それじゃあ聞いてください！\nオレたちの新曲……。", "zh": "好——！那么请听！\n我们的新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
